# Annual Leave Policy
Full-time employees accrue paid annual leave monthly starting on their hire date.

## Entitlement by Tenure
| Tenure | Annual Days | Max Carryover |
|---|---|---|
| 0-2 years | 25 | 5 |
| 3+ years | 30 | 10 |

## Remote Work Equipment
Each employee receives an annual $1,000 stipend for ergonomic office hardware and monitors.
